<DocsExample TExample="FeedViewCardsExample" Title="Responsive card feed" Description="NTFeedView lays direct children out in a grid and adds columns as space allows. Each child should be a self-contained card." />
<DocsExample TExample="FeedViewMinItemWidthExample" Title="Minimum item width" Description="MinItemWidth sets how narrow an item may get before the grid drops a column. Larger values give richer cards fewer columns." />
